#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:2
msgid "audio-record interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `audio-record` interface allows an application to access your audio "
"recording hardware, such as a microphone, via your system's audio service, "
"such as PulseAudio. It's disabled by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"This interface is a companion interface to the {ref}`audio-playback "
"<interfaces-audio-playback-interface>` interface, and is not intended to be "
"used without it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:8
msgid "<h2 id='heading--example'>Example</h2>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"The brilliant [OBS Studio](https://snapcraft.io/obs-studio) is a good "
"example of an application that needs access to your microphone/audio "
"recording hardware."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:12
msgid "$ sudo snap connect obs-studio:audio-record\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:17
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:19
msgid "**Auto-connect**: no"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:21
msgid ""
"The design of this interface is based on the principle that the slot "
"implementation of the audio service, such as {ref}`PulseAudio <interfaces-"
"pulseaudio-interface>`, queries whether its audio-record slot is connected, "
"leaving the audio service to mediate recording if it is."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:23
msgid ""
"On systems with snapd integration, PulseAudio's mediation is limited and "
"will only verify that the *snap* is connected to `audio-record` and not if "
"the specific snap command plugs the interface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:25
msgid "<h3 id='heading-code'>Code examples</h3>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:27
msgid ""
"Mumble is a voice chat platform and a good example of an application using "
"audio-record. Its snapcraft.yaml can be found here: [https://github.com/"
"snapcrafters/mumble/blob/master/snap/snapcraft.yaml](https://github.com/"
"snapcrafters/mumble/blob/b5f1644a72a14cacd17b862cd0265d21d8ce604a/snap/"
"snapcraft.yaml#L21)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/audio-record-interface.md:30
msgid ""
"The source code for this interface is in the *snapd* repository: <https://"
"github.com/canonical/snapd/blob/master/interfaces/builtin/audio_record.go>"
msgstr ""
